    "name": "Gretchen: Queen of Crows",
    "steam_appid": 1475370,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475370/extras/74bb7b0b474763c579cb7f08da12cb60.avif?t=1732202947\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore an otherworldly purgatory with hand drawn environments brimming with strange creatures and secrets to uncover..</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock unique abilities that allow for interesting traversal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Accessible and intuitive combat centered around timing and reflexes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a twisted reimagining of Hansel and Gretel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Fully voiced performances and a variety of characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Original music score designed to immerse players in the atmosphere and narrative.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475370/extras/74bb7b0b474763c579cb7f08da12cb60.avif?t=1732202947\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore an otherworldly purgatory with hand drawn environments brimming with strange creatures and secrets to uncover..</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock unique abilities that allow for interesting traversal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Accessible and intuitive combat centered around timing and reflexes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a twisted reimagining of Hansel and Gretel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Fully voiced performances and a variety of characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Original music score designed to immerse players in the atmosphere and narrative.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In a twisted reimagining of Hansel and Gretel, follow Penelope as she explores and fights through a surreal nightmare to rescue her sister from an enigmatic force of temptation determined to shatter their will and claim their souls.",
